{
  "question": "What is the cause of the pronounced downward drift in resonator_obs after day 10 and its unusually strong delayed (3‑day offset) reading‑by‑reading correlation with pendulum_lab, while resonator_lab drifts modestly upward and both pendulum instruments remain statistically stable?",
